      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَغْمِيسٌ</span></b>  signifies The <i>making a drinking to
be little in quantity:</i> (O, K, TA:) or, accord. to
Kr, a man's <i>watering</i> his camels <i>and then going
away.</i> (TA.)

